havioral metadata\n- 16-30: small contained implementation/test change with no measured-path or remote-write effect\n- 31-50: contained CLI, frontend, strategy, or result change with bounded impact\n- 51-70: concurrency, common Git path, public contract, measurement, auth, or multi-package change\n- 71-85: broad remote-write behavior, misleading benchmark output, credential flow, schema break, or cleanup/cancellation risk\n- 86-100: likely unauthorized load, writes/deletes against unintended refs or repos, credential disclosure, or systematically invalid published results\n\nOutput ONLY this JSON object as the final line:\n\n{\"value\":<number 0-100>,\"rationale\":\"<1-2 evidence-based sentences>\"}"
