e:\n- 0-15: aligned with existing packages, contracts, and benchmark direction\n- 16-30: minor local inconsistency with no structural effect\n- 31-50: a new pattern or boundary adjustment that is mostly justified\n- 51-70: duplicated ownership, frontend/core leakage, scattered strategy logic, or avoidable dependency/scope expansion\n- 71-85: fundamental deviation from real-Git measurement or the reusable engine/result architecture\n- 86-100: changes turn ForgeMark into a materially different or misleading system while bypassing its core contracts\n\nOutput ONLY this JSON object as the final line:\n\n{\"value\":<number 0-100>,\"rationale\":\"<1-2 evidence-based sentences>\"}"
  },
